Caveats:
- Dotfiles symlink into this repo; don't move it.
- NetworkManager is enabled by profiles; remove if you use something else.
- dev profile: run `sudo usermod -aG docker $USER` then log out/in.
- make your own dotfiles dont be a npc
- doesnt account for your desktop environment so configure it yourself
